  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli bakoirana korwa ase obosomba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene narorere ororeeria rwa Yakobo amaabera, nachore Abaisraeli abwo naende, abarente bamenye ase ense yabo. Abanto abaao mbabwatane nab’ororeeria rwa Yakobo, bamenye amo nabarabwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebisaku binde mbikonye Abaisraeli koirana ase ense yabo, na Abaisraeli mbaabakore babe abasomba babo, abasacha na abakungu, mbabe bakobakorera agwo ase ense y’Omonene. Abaisraeli mboose abwo baboosete kare, na bagambere abwo baarenge kobakorera bobe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti o Babiloni ore aase abakuure",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebe ekero Omonene abaeire ogotimoka korwa ase emechando yaino, na obokong’u, na emeremo emekong’u mwarenge gokorigwa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "erio mokwane amang’ana aya y’ogochecheria omorwoti o Babiloni, moteebe: “Naki omochandi oria akirigwe! Obotindi bw’ogochandwa gwaito bwaerire!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene obunire enyimbo y’abakori amabe, enyimbo eyio y’abagaambi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abwo baagete abanto nendamwamu, na bakaba bakobaaka batari gotiga. Nigo bagamberete ebisaku nendamwamu, bakaba bakobichanda batari namaabera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono ense engima nigo etimogete na gotoerera. Abanto bagokire na goteera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonya nemetarakwa nigo egokerete okobugwa kwao, na emecharake ya Lebanoni nigo egoteeba: Gese gwakaiyeretigwe inse, omotemi emete onde tana gotochera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aase abakuure abeire nomoegaego gocha gokorotota ekero okogenda aroro; emerengari y’abakuure yaturirwe ase engencho yao, ee, abwo bonsi baarenge abatang’ani b’ense. Abwo bonsi baarenge abarwoti b’ebisaku batenenigwe barue ase ebirogo biabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abwo bonsi mbakwane, bagoteebie: Bono naye kwaurirwe chinguru buna intwe, gwatogwekanire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obonene bwao amo namariogi ’amakano ao biarentirwe aiga aase abakuure; ebinyegera nabio ekeraarero kiao na amakonde naro ekiebisio kiao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye eng’enang’eni ya mambia, omwana bw’ogokiamoka, naki kwagure korwa igoro! Aye oria kwaiyeretie ebisaku, naki gwatugutetwe gocha inse?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo gwateebete ase enkoro yao ime: Inche nintiire gochia igoro aaria, ngende ng’etanie ching’enang’eni chia Nyasae, nimbeeke ekerogo kiane ki’obonene aaria igoro. Ning’ikaranse ase egetunwa ki’omosangererekano aaria sugusu aare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nintiire ngende ng’etanie amare are igoro mono, ninyekore imbe buna Oyore Igoro Mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende bono aye kwairirwe gochia aase abakuure ase engoro entambe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abanto abwo barakorore mbakorigererie baasamie emenwa yabo bakumie, mbabe bakorengereria igoro yao, bateebe: Inee! Omonto oyo nere oria otengechetie ense, oria onyegeretie amarwoti?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nere oyio osaretie ense ekaba erooro, naende akaonchorana emechie y’ense, oria otarenge gosibora abasibwa baye bagende ase chinka chiabo?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abarwoti bonsi b’ebisaku nigo baraire nobonene bwabo, kera oyomo ase embeera yaye,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korende aye totindekiri; nigo otugutire buna orosagia rotanchiri. Nigo oraire ase egati y’abanto baitetwe nemioro, bagatugutwa ase chingoro chi’amagena buna ebitondo bigotachwa namagoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye togotindekwa buna abarwoti bande, ekiagera gwasaririe ense yao, naende gwaitire abanto bao. Ororeria rw’abakori amabe tirogwatorwa nonya ng’ake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beka abanto ang’e, baite abamura b’omorwoti oyio; abana abwo nigo baraitwe ase engencho y’okomocha gwa chisokoro chiabo, tibaabaisa koimokerera igoro baire ense na koyeichoria nemechie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyasae nasarie Babiloni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene bw’Emeganda nigo agoteeba iga: “Nimbaimokere, nsarie Babiloni kegima, ninsirie erieta riaye na abatigari bare aroro. Tingotiga abana aroro gose abachokoro. Inche Omonene bw’Emeganda nateebire ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninkore Babiloni obe obomenyo bw’ebirongo, naende obe ne chitente chi’amaache. Ninyoabusere ekiabuso ki’ogosiria. Inche Omonene bw’Emeganda nateebire ayio.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyasae nasirie Abaasuri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene bw’Emeganda otianire, ogoteeba, “Ekeene, buna narobeirie, nabo arabe, na buna nachiikire, goika aikerane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninsenyente Abaasuri aiga ase ense yane, nimbatiri-tiringere inse agwo ase ebitunwa biane. Ase enchera eyio amakorogoto abo narusigwe ase amagoti ’Abaisraeli, n’echigurube chiabo chirusigwe ase amareko abo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya naro achikirwe igoro y’ense yonsi, na oko nakwo okoboko koramboire igoro ase abanto b’ebisaku bionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene bw’Emeganda ochikiire gokora amang’ana ayio, ning’o oranyare koyatanga taba? Oramboire okoboko kwaye, ning’o oranyare gokoringa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyasae nasirie Abafirisiti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka oria Ahasi omorwoti akwete, amang’ana aya naro araaretigwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe Abafirisiti mwensi, timobaisa kogoka ng’a enyimbo eria yabaagete yabunirwe; korwa ase ritina ri’eng’iti eria ende ere nobosongo obotindi nesoke, na korwa ase eyio enchoka ekoiruruka netuboke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abare abataka mono mbaragerigwe, na abaremeire bamenye n’obotoereru. Korende abare ritina riaino mbaite nenchara, na abatigari baino nimbaite.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
